{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有；X 的感受词偶尔堆叠、同义反复，部分比喻过度解释情绪，Y 在这方面更干净、克制。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 的左右分栏更容易快速扫读，叙述和感受也不容易混在一起；但 X 的关键词加亮能迅速抓住心理转折，而且感受词分时出现，减少了同时阅读的负担。更重要的是，X 对人物心理因果和前后变化交代得更完整，尤其是 S06 的孤单、S11 的相互需要、S13 对永恒保证的渴望与恐惧，Y 都有不同程度的简化。X 的音乐同步感受也更细腻，能让人听见情绪如何变化，因此整体体验我选 X，主要遗憾是个别感受提示不够克制。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d33a3648-ddde-49e4-ba76-61fb2f33b4c5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T230821022630Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:09:36.989077+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8e034b0891a974142d28ee9b9a14fa54be593a186cfbfcf51c734e5d25f38945", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha